# psxrecomp vendored-dependency pins.
#
# THE single record of every source archive the build may fetch. Both
# cmake/psx_dependency_archive.cmake and tools/ci/vendor_deps.sh read this
# file, so a vendored archive under third_party/ can never drift from the
# URL/hash the build would otherwise download.
#
# Columns, whitespace-separated:
#   name    FetchContent name used in the CMake files
#   file    archive name under third_party/ (vendored form)
#   sha256  digest of that archive; also the URL_HASH of the upstream pin
#   url     upstream download location
#
# Only psx_libchdr and libjuice are committed. libchdr is the one dependency
# with no local fallback (no find_package path, no toolchain-pack copy), so a
# build with no network dies at it. libjuice is what recomp-net's ICE transport
# FetchContents when PSX_NETPLAY=ON; its row must match the URL and hash
# recomp-net pins (lib/recomp-net/CMakeLists.txt). SDL3 and zlib resolve from a system package or a
# cmake-clang-v1 toolchain pack first; run tools/ci/vendor_deps.sh to stage
# them here as well for a fully air-gapped tree.
#
# name          file                                                     sha256                                                            url
psx_libchdr     libchdr-6cde5348eb118da3baf94f75a69577a005a484fd.tar.gz   a222b1f1c842f988c2aad51e5f56ba94a423ed87ccab71f1abdb757caa7444f5  https://github.com/rtissera/libchdr/archive/6cde5348eb118da3baf94f75a69577a005a484fd.tar.gz
SDL3            SDL3-3.4.10.tar.gz                                       12b34280415ec8418c864408b93d008a20a6530687ee613d60bfbd20411f2785  https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/releases/download/release-3.4.10/SDL3-3.4.10.tar.gz
psx_zlib        zlib-1.3.1.tar.gz                                        9a93b2b7dfdac77ceba5a558a580e74667dd6fede4585b91eefb60f03b72df23  https://github.com/madler/zlib/releases/download/v1.3.1/zlib-1.3.1.tar.gz
libjuice        libjuice-v1.7.2.tar.gz                                   75159867c4a5a689a6559e11aa0d30c9eba12ce73a4ae3d898b521467e1f635d  https://github.com/paullouisageneau/libjuice/archive/refs/tags/v1.7.2.tar.gz
psx_openxr_sdk OpenXR-SDK-b76b80adaf65ac3ad6cc1ce61974fb29a5d02352.tar.gz fb8962fe83ca8a5987ebb3d717aa297ea355540449fa230b25307824eab800f4  https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenXR-SDK/archive/b76b80adaf65ac3ad6cc1ce61974fb29a5d02352.tar.gz
psx_libwebp     libwebp-4fa21912338357f89e4fd51cf2368325b59e9bd9.tar.gz  923f3382a47a2af185c3240c954cf004428b237bd7317413a95146d01eb4b94b  https://codeload.github.com/webmproject/libwebp/tar.gz/4fa21912338357f89e4fd51cf2368325b59e9bd9
